PHY_MICR_INT_OE|PHY Enable output interrupt events|Extended : External PHY Configuration||0x0000|0xFFFF|PHY name
PHY_MISR_LINK_INT_EN|Enable Interrupt on change of link status|Extended : External PHY Configuration||0x0000|0xFFFF|PHY name
PHY_LINK_INTERRUPT|PHY link status interrupt mask|Extended : External PHY Configuration||0x0000|0xFFFF|PHY name
PHY_ISFR|PHY Interrupt Source Flag register Offset|Extended : External PHY Configuration||0x0000|0xFFFF|PHY name
